# PROSALE Release Keystore Signing Configuration Example
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULES:
# 1. NEVER commit your actual 'keystore.properties' file to Git or GitHub!
# 2. NEVER commit your private '.jks' or '.keystore' file to Git or GitHub!
# 3. Keep a safe offline backup of your keystore file and passwords.
#    If the keystore is lost, you will NOT be able to publish updates to existing installations.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# SETUP INSTRUCTIONS:
# 1. Generate a permanent release keystore (if you haven't already):
#    keytool -genkey -v -keystore prosale-release.jks -alias prosale -keyalg RSA -keysize 2048 -validity 10000
#
# 2. Copy this file to:
#    android/app/keystore.properties  (or android/keystore.properties)
#
# 3. Fill in your actual values below:
storeFile=../../prosale-release.jks
storePassword=YOUR_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD
keyAlias=prosale
keyPassword=YOUR_KEY_PASSWORD
